Wedding Day Timeline: The Order of the Day

A wedding day in order:
• hair and makeup, at 45–60 minutes per person;
• everyone dressed with a 30-minute cushion;
• photos and an optional first look;
• a 20–40 minute ceremony;
• about an hour of cocktails;
• the reception, with entrance, dinner, toasts and dances;
• the send-off.

Plus the buffers that keep the day from running late.

